{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tiny Sheriff is a 2D movement platformer where you use weapons as a means of transportation. Master your movement capabilities to take on increasingly daring challenges.</p><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566060/extras/guns.png?t=1741724809\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566060/extras/cactusgif.gif?t=1741724809\" /><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your guns are more than just weapons\u2014they\u2019re your way of getting around! The knock-back from each shot propels you through the air, letting you dash, double-jump, and wall-bounce your way through treacherous terrain. But be careful\u2014taking down enemies can throw you backwards, sending you hurtling into danger!</p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566060/extras/bosses.png?t=1741724809\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566060/extras/bossgif.gif?t=1741724809\" /><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These showdowns are fast, chaotic, and unforgiving. Dodge incoming attacks, keep your momentum, and find the right moment to strike. Stay sharp, stay quick\u2014hesitate, and you\u2019re done for.</p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566060/extras/cacti.png?t=1741724809\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566060/extras/cactus2gif.gif?t=1741724809\" /><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cacti aren\u2019t just scenery\u2014they\u2019re out to mess with you. Get too close, and you\u2019ll be eating spikes. Step wrong, and you\u2019ll quickly find yourself in a thorny mess.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566060?t=1741724809","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566060/e7ae2530479647801be2fb92c18d5835cec3ced1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741724809","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566060/9b289d55e9ea9af4a120252c9cf4ba4e1e38b120/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741724809","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566060/9b289d55e9ea9af4a120252c9cf4ba4e1e38b120/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741724809","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tiny Sheriff is a 2D movement platformer where you use weapons as a means of transportation. Master your movement capabilities to take on increasingly daring challenges.</p><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566060/extras/guns.png?t=1741724809\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566060/extras/cactusgif.gif?t=1741724809\" /><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your guns are more than just weapons\u2014they\u2019re your way of getting around! The knock-back from each shot propels you through the air, letting you dash, double-jump, and wall-bounce your way through treacherous terrain. But be careful\u2014taking down enemies can throw you backwards, sending you hurtling into danger!</p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566060/extras/bosses.png?t=1741724809\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566060/extras/bossgif.gif?t=1741724809\" /><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These showdowns are fast, chaotic, and unforgiving. Dodge incoming attacks, keep your momentum, and find the right moment to strike. Stay sharp, stay quick\u2014hesitate, and you\u2019re done for.</p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566060/extras/cacti.png?t=1741724809\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566060/extras/cactus2gif.gif?t=1741724809\" /><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cacti aren\u2019t just scenery\u2014they\u2019re out to mess with you. Get too close, and you\u2019ll be eating spikes. Step wrong, and you\u2019ll quickly find yourself in a thorny mess.</p>","developers":["Rotgut Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566060/623ff784d646ed7e061a47dfa4a7f6d698352c91/header.jpg?t=1741724809","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or AMD Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 10 Feature Compatible AMD or NVIDIA<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257111542,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111542/movie480.mp4?t=1741724807","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111542/movie_max.mp4?t=1741724807"},"name":"Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257111542/717910a2989697c503ee087dfefdc73fbca32304/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741724807","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111542/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741724807","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111542/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741724807"}}],"name":"Tiny Sheriff","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or A